		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--fg-light);
	}

	a.svelte-bp2yyv {
		color: var(--fg-light);
	}

	/* prevent crazy overflow layout bug on mobile */
	.body.svelte-bp2yyv * {
		overflow-wrap: break-word;
	}

	.comment.svelte-bp2yyv pre {
		overflow-x: auto;
